  "expirationDate": "2036-02-07",
  "historyNote": "#6953, eff 3-1-99 (formerly Ins 1101.05); ss by #8826, eff 3-1-07, EXPIRED: 3-1-15 New. #10866, eff 7-1-15; ss by #14512, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36",
